+These files are ready to paste into the matching Supabase Auth email templates. **Custom SMTP must be enabled for this project before Supabase allows custom email templates to be edited.** Supabase email delivery also needs a working SMTP provider and an allowed redirect URL for the deployed app. These files do not change hosted project settings.
