+The suggested subjects are also collected in [subjects.md](./subjects.md). The Confirm signup HTML and text files must be pasted into Supabase Dashboard → Authentication → Emails → Templates → Confirm signup. Add the production site URL and any preview URLs used for testing to Authentication → URL Configuration → Redirect URLs.
